On the map of [[Elona]]:
{{Quotation|game|The swirling Vortex, unleashed by the death of [[Varesh Ossa]], leads to the [[Realm of Torment]].}}

On the map in the [[Realm of Torment]]:
{{Quotation|game|The Vortex leads back to the mortal realm.}}

The [[Vortex]] is the portal to the Realm of Torment, where the ending of the game takes place. It is also the only way to go to and from the Realm of Torment before completion of [[Abaddon's Gate]]. The Vortex will lead either to the [[Gate of Torment]] or [[the Mouth of Torment]].

When you are near the Vortex in the Mouth of Torment, you suffer the environment effect [[Approaching the Vortex]].

